#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:154
msgid ""
"Ensure the load balancer supports **long-lived connections** — STOMP "
"agent connections are persistent"
msgstr "Sicherstellen, dass der Load Balancer **langlebige Verbindungen** unterstützt — STOMP-Agent-Verbindungen sind persistent"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:157
msgid "TLS Configuration"
msgstr "TLS-Konfiguration"

#: ../../getting_started/external_services/rabbitmq.rst:159
msgid "To secure RabbitMQ communications with TLS:"
